I don't even know this
man, but I'm saying.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.712
- Thank you, thank you.

00:07:54.712 --> 00:07:55.727
- It's not hoarding, it's not

00:07:55.727 --> 00:07:59.800
and it's not a doomsday prepper,
it's just being prepared.

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:01.730
- For every single situation.
- It's just being prepared.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.250
Everyone's coming to my
house too, so whatever.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.210
- Yeah, like he gave me a satellite phone

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.043
for our wrapped gift.

00:08:06.043 --> 00:08:07.370
- [Kelly] Oh my God, I
have a satellite phone.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:09.575
- Yeah, that's like really thinking.

00:08:09.575 --> 00:08:10.408
- [Kelly] That's a normal
thing if something happens.

00:08:10.408 --> 00:08:11.590
- We should probably exchange
satellite phone numbers,

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:12.781
just in case...
(beeping)

00:08:12.781 --> 00:08:13.614
Goes down.
(audience laughs)

00:08:13.614 --> 00:08:14.597
- I'll be like,

00:08:14.597 --> 00:08:17.309
"Listen, I'm checking in with
Kelly Clarkson right now".

00:08:17.309 --> 00:08:18.180
(audience laughs)

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.040
How're we doing over there, Kelly?

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.660
- She is in the mountains of Montana,

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.670
that's where I will be.
(Kelly laughs)

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.220
So wait, who would you pick though?

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.771
- I'm going to go with Sam
Neill, he's got a farm.

00:08:25.771 --> 00:08:26.912
(Bryce and DeWanda gasp)

00:08:26.912 --> 00:08:28.230
He lives in New Zealand.
- Yes.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.410
- [Kelly] He lives in New Zealand?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:30.390
- And he's got two paddocks.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.500
And you know, if it's
the end of the world,

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:32.843
I'm just drinking with Sam Neill.

00:08:32.843 --> 00:08:33.676
- [DeWanda] Why did I follow the rules?

00:08:33.676 --> 00:08:34.509
- [Bryce] He has a winery.

00:08:34.509 --> 00:08:35.342
- Why did I follow the rules?

00:08:35.342 --> 00:08:37.480
Both of you were like,
people who aren't here.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.313
- [Kelly] Wait, he has a winery?

00:08:38.313 --> 00:08:39.520
Well, what's that mean to you?

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.080
- [Bryce] Nothing.
(Bryce laughs)

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.752
- [Kelly] Okay, I was like, "Wait, what?"

00:08:42.752 --> 00:08:43.585
- Yeah, right.

00:08:43.585 --> 00:08:45.180
- Nothing, but for everybody else.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.832
I mean, it's you, you, you are correct.

00:08:47.832 --> 00:08:48.665
- [Mamoudou] I, yes.
(Mamoudou laughs)

00:08:48.665 --> 00:08:50.040
- [Kelly] This is who I'm going to pick,

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.760
I feel like I'm prepared
enough, I don't need him.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.780
But, I, I think I'm
picking the non-alcoholic,

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.331
so I can just have it all to myself.

00:08:56.331 --> 00:08:57.164
(audience laughs)

00:08:57.164 --> 00:08:58.310
Because if..
(beeping)

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:01.672
Is actually hitting the fan,
I'm going to need alcohol.

00:09:01.672 --> 00:09:03.400
So, just, just slow it down.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:04.953
You know, some of us are ADHD.

